{"data": [{"id": 6097, "slug": "pick-up-a-grimoire-become-a-mage", "title": "Pick Up a Grimoire, Become a Mage", "description": "<p>[By the <strong>Studio</strong> that brought you &lt;<strong><em>Lookism</em></strong>&gt; and &lt;<strong><em>The Shepherd Wizard</em></strong>&gt;!]<br><br><br>A single grimoire found in an old bookshop changed his life forever. </p><p>A college student forms a contract with an invisible vampire that tears people apart and kills them. Hiding his true identity, he must grow into a mage in this modern occult coming-of-age fantasy.</p>", "cover": "https://cdn.asurascans.com/asura-images/covers/pick-up-a-grimoire-become-a-mage.1bf474.webp", "status": "ongoing", "type": "manhwa", "author": "Bangguseok Waryong", "release_year": 2026, "popularity_rank": 171, "bookmark_count": 12062, "rating": 9.202702702702704, "chapter_count": 6, "last_chapter_at": "2026-10-10T16:08:04.666458Z", "is_pinned": true, "created_at": "2026-10-07T12:59:30.595872Z", "updated_at": "2026-10-11T15:16:09.075669Z", "public_url": "/comics/pick-up-a-grimoire-become-a-mage-bd5bdaf8", "source_url": "/s/6097", "genres": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action", "slug": "action"}, {"id": 4, "name": "Adventure", "slug": "adventure"}, {"id": 16, "name": "Fantasy", "slug": "fantasy"}, {"id": 28, "name": "Magic", "slug": "magic"}], "latest_chapters": [{"id": 262083, "series_id": 0, "number": 6, "slug": "chapter-6", "page_count": 0, "is_premium": false, "comments_enabled": false, "early_access_until": "2026-10-10T22:08:04.666458Z", "published_at": "2026-10-10T16:08:04.666458Z", "view_count": 0, "created_at": "0001-01-01T00:00:00Z"}, {"id": 262082, "series_id": 0, "number": 5, "slug": "chapter-5", "page_count": 0, "is_premium": false, "comments_enabled": false, "early_access_until": "2026-10-10T22:07:35.310365Z", "published_at": "2026-10-10T16:07:35.310365Z", "view_count": 0, "created_at": "0001-01-01T00:00:00Z"}, {"id": 262076, "series_id": 0, "number": 4, "slug": "chapter-4", "page_count": 0, "is_premium": false, "comments_enabled": false, "early_access_until": "2026-10-10T20:42:47.979043Z", "published_at": "2026-10-10T14:42:47.979043Z", "view_count": 0, "created_at": "0001-01-01T00:00:00Z"}], "linked_novel": {"id": 29, "title": "Pick Up a Grimoire, Become a Mage", "slug": "i-picked-up-a-grimoire-and-became-a-wizard", "cover_url": "https://cdn.asurascans.com/asura-images/covers/i-picked-up-a-grimoire-and-became-a-wizard.b093de.webp", "chapter_count": 101, "status": "ongoing"}}, {"id": 2136, "slug": "the-heavenly-demon-wants-a-quiet-life", "title": "The Heavenly Demon Wants a Quiet Life", "alt_titles": ["Cheonma Wants to Live Quietly", "The Heavenly Demon Wants to Live Quietly", "\u0e0a\u0e32\u0e15\u0e34\u0e19\u0e35\u0e49\u0e40\u0e17\u0e1e\u0e21\u0e32\u0e23\u0e02\u0e2d\u0e0a\u0e34\u0e25", "\ucc9c\ub9c8\ub294 \uc870\uc6a9\ud788 \uc0b4\uace0\uc2f6\ub2e4", "\u5929\u9b54\u60f3\u4f4e\u8abf\u904e\u65e5\u5b50", "Thi\u00ean Ma Mu\u1ed1n S\u1ed1ng Cu\u1ed9c \u0110\u1eddi B\u00ecnh Th\u01b0\u1eddng", "El demonio celestial quiere una vida tranquila", "\u5929\u9b54\u53ea\u60f3\u82df\u7740", "\u3084\u308a\u76f4\u3057\u5929\u9b54\u306f\u9759\u304b\u306b\u66ae\u3089\u3057\u305f\u3044", "\u041d\u0435\u0431\u0435\u0441\u043d\u044b\u0439 \u0414\u0435\u043c\u043e\u043d \u0445\u043e\u0447\u0435\u0442 \u0436\u0438\u0442\u044c \u0432 \u0442\u0438\u0448\u0438\u043d\u0435", "Heavenly Demon Wants to Live Quietly", "The Heavenly Demon Desires a Peaceful Life", "Heavenly Demon Desires Peace", "Cheonmanimeun Joyonghi Salgo Sipda", "Thi\u00ean Ma Mu\u1ed1n S\u1ed1ng Y\u00ean B\u00ecnh", "Le D\u00e9mon C\u00e9leste veut une vie tranquille", "O Dem\u00f4nio Celestial Quer Uma Vida Tranquila", "Iblis Surgawi Ingin Hidup Tenang", "\ucc9c\ub9c8\ub2d8\uc740 \uc870\uc6a9\ud788 \uc0b4\uace0 \uc2f6\ub2e4", "\u5929\u9b54\u69d8\u306f\u9759\u304b\u306b\u66ae\u3089\u3057\u305f\u3044", "\u5929\u9b54\u5927\u4eba\u60f3\u8fc7\u5e73\u9759\u7684\u751f\u6d3b", "\u041d\u0435\u0431\u0435\u0441\u043d\u044b\u0439 \u0414\u0435\u043c\u043e\u043d \u0445\u043e\u0447\u0435\u0442 \u0441\u043f\u043e\u043a\u043e\u0439\u043d\u043e\u0439 \u0436\u0438\u0437\u043d\u0438", "\u0627\u0644\u0634\u064a\u0637\u0627\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u0633\u0645\u0627\u0648\u064a \u064a\u0631\u064a\u062f \u062d\u064a\u0627\u0629 \u0647\u0627\u062f\u0626\u0629", "\u0e21\u0e32\u0e23\u0e2a\u0e27\u0e23\u0e23\u0e04\u0e4c\u0e2d\u0e22\u0e32\u0e01\u0e43\u0e0a\u0e49\u0e0a\u0e35\u0e27\u0e34\u0e15\u0e2d\u0e22\u0e48\u0e32\u0e07\u0e2a\u0e07\u0e1a\u0e2a\u0e38\u0e02"], "description": "<p>\"In my next life, I wish to walk a completely different path\u2026\"</p><p>The Heavenly Demon, whose life revolved around fear and reverence, gained a crucial clue to mastering the Soul-Augmentation Art at the moment of his death:</p><p>The \"Soul-Augmentation Art\" wasn't just about consuming the souls of others.</p><p>The Heavenly Demon then awakened in the body of Byeok Taesan, a frail young noble who could die at any moment...</p><p>To survive, he must make his way to the courtesan house!</p><p>The Heavenly Demon, now transformed into the \"Night King,\" begins his ambitious journey of survival.</p>", "cover": "https://cdn.asurascans.com/asura-images/covers/the-heavenly-demon-wants-a-quiet-life.b91da3.webp", "banner": "https://cdn.asurascans.com/asura-images/banners/the-heavenly-demon-wants-a-quiet-life.jpg", "status": "ongoing", "type": "manhwa", "author": "Gijema", "artist": "Studio JHS", "popularity_rank": 94, "bookmark_count": 33916, "rating": 9.075887392900857, "chapter_count": 100, "last_chapter_at": "2026-10-11T15:16:39.542691Z", "created_at": "0001-01-01T00:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-10-11T15:22:04.019922Z", "public_url": "/comics/the-heavenly-demon-wants-a-quiet-life-bd5bdaf8", "source_url": "/s/2136", "genres": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action", "slug": "action"}, {"id": 4, "name": "Adventure", "slug": "adventure"}, {"id": 34, "name": "Murim", "slug": "murim"}, {"id": 44, "name": "Reincarnation", "slug": "reincarnation"}], "latest_chapters": [{"id": 262155, "series_id": 0, "number": 100, "slug": "chapter-100", "page_count": 0, "is_premium": true, "comments_enabled": false, "early_access_until": "2026-10-11T21:16:39.542691Z", "published_at": "2026-10-11T15:16:39.542691Z", "view_count": 0, "created_at": "0001-01-01T00:00:00Z"}, {"id": 261865, "series_id": 0, "number": 99, "slug": "chapter-99", "page_count": 0, "is_premium": false, "comments_enabled": false, "early_access_until": "2026-09-30T08:30:46.242653Z", "published_at": "2026-09-30T02:30:46.242653Z", "view_count": 0, "created_at": "0001-01-01T00:00:00Z"}, {"id": 261709, "series_id": 0, "number": 98, "slug": "chapter-98", "page_count": 0, "is_premium": false, "comments_enabled": false, "early_access_until": "2026-09-24T02:28:25.499321Z", "published_at": "2026-09-23T20:28:25.499321Z", "view_count": 0, "created_at": "0001-01-01T00:00:00Z"}]}, {"id": 2055, "slug": "revenge-of-the-iron-blooded-sword-hound", "title": "Revenge of the Iron-Blooded Sword Hound", "alt_titles": ["\u0639\u0648\u062f\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0643\u0644\u0628 \u0630\u064a \u0627\u0644\u062f\u0645 \u0627\u0644\u062d\u062f\u064a\u062f\u064a", "Kuduz Han\u00e7erin \u0130ntikam\u0131", "Die R\u00fcckkehr des Jagdhundes aus Eisen und Blut", "\u0e01\u0e32\u0e23\u0e01\u0e25\u0e31\u0e1a\u0e21\u0e32\u0e02\u0e2d\u0e07\u0e2b\u0e21\u0e32\u0e25\u0e48\u0e32\u0e40\u0e19\u0e37\u0e49\u0e2d\u0e15\u0e23\u0e30\u0e01\u0e39\u0e25\u0e14\u0e32\u0e1a\u0e40\u0e25\u0e37\u0e2d\u0e14\u0e40\u0e2b\u0e25\u0e47\u0e01", "Revenge of the Baskerville Bloodhound", "Return of the Iron-Blooded Sword Hound", "Regression of the Ironblade Hound", "La revanche du limier des Baskerville", "The Return of the Iron-Blood Sword Hound", "Demir Kanl\u0131 K\u0131l\u0131\u00e7 Taz\u0131s\u0131n\u0131n \u0130ntikam\u0131", "La Venganza del Sabueso de Sangre de Hierro", "Cheolhyeol Geomga Sanyanggae-ui Hoegwi", "La venganza del sabueso de la espada sangrienta", "Revenge of the Sword Clan's Hound", "\u56de\u5e30\u3057\u305f\u9244\u8840\u306e\u731f\u72ac", "\ucca0\ud608\uac80\uac00 \uc0ac\ub0e5\uac1c\uc758 \ud68c\uadc0", "\ucca0\ud608\uac80\uac00", "The Iron-Blooded Sword Hound's Regression", "Iron-Blooded Sword Hound", "Return of the Sword Hound", "Cheolhyeolgeonga Sanyanggaeui Hoegwi", "\u9244\u8840\u5263\u83ef\u306e\u731f\u72ac", "\u94c1\u8840\u5251\u5bb6\u730e\u72ac\u7684\u56de\u5f52", "\u0412\u043e\u0437\u0432\u0440\u0430\u0449\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0435 \u043e\u0445\u043e\u0442\u043d\u0438\u0447\u044c\u0435\u0439 \u0441\u043e\u0431\u0430\u043a\u0438 \u0440\u043e\u0434\u0430 \u0416\u0435\u043b\u0435\u0437\u043d\u043e\u0439 \u041a\u0440\u043e\u0432\u0438", "\u0627\u0646\u062a\u0642\u0627\u0645 \u0643\u0644\u0628 \u0627\u0644\u0635\u064a\u062f \u0630\u0648 \u0627\u0644\u062f\u0645 \u0627\u0644\u062d\u062f\u064a\u062f\u064a", "S\u1ef1 Tr\u1ea3 Th\u00f9 C\u1ee7a Ch\u00f3 S\u0103n M\u00e1u S\u1eaft", "La Revanche du Chien de Chasse \u00e0 Sang Froid", "La Venganza del Perro de Caza de Sangre de Hierro", "A Vingan\u00e7a do C\u00e3o de Ca\u00e7a de Sangre de Ferro", "Balas Dendam Anjing Pemburu Pedang Berdarah Besi", "\u0e2b\u0e21\u0e32\u0e25\u0e48\u0e32\u0e40\u0e19\u0e37\u0e49\u0e2d\u0e2a\u0e35\u0e40\u0e25\u0e37\u0e2d\u0e14\u0e41\u0e2b\u0e48\u0e07\u0e15\u0e23\u0e30\u0e01\u0e39\u0e25\u0e19\u0e31\u0e01\u0e14\u0e32\u0e1a"], "description": "He was the hound of the Baskerville family: Vikir.Yet his loyalty was rewarded by the blade of a guillotine dirtied by slander.\"I will never live the life of a hound slaughtered after the rabbit is caught.\"In place of death, an unexpected opportunity awaits him.Vikir's eyes glowed red as he sharpened his canines in the dark.\"Just you wait, Hugo. I will rip out your throat this time.\"It's time for the hound to exact bloody revenge on his owner.</p>", "cover": "https://cdn.asurascans.com/asura-images/covers/revenge-of-the-iron-blooded-sword-hound.41b6fb.webp", "banner": "https://cdn.asurascans.com/asura-images/banners/revenge-of-the-iron-blooded-sword-hound.42b9e7.webp", "status": "ongoing", "type": "manhwa", "author": "I Stepped On Lego", "artist": "REDICE Studio", "popularity_rank": 14, "bookmark_count": 171598, "rating": 9.321164399904557, "chapter_count": 185, "last_chapter_at": "2026-10-11T15:15:42.322478Z", "created_at": "0001-01-01T00:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-10-11T15:21:50.901014Z", "public_url": "/comics/revenge-of-the-iron-blooded-sword-hound-bd5bdaf8", "source_url": "/s/2055", "genres": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action", "slug": "action"}, {"id": 4, "name": "Adventure", "slug": "adventure"}, {"id": 16, "name": "Fantasy", "slug": "fantasy"}, {"id": 43, "name": "Regression", "slug": "regression"}, {"id": 48, "name": "Revenge", "slug": "revenge"}], "latest_chapters": [{"id": 262154, "series_id": 0, "number": 184, "slug": "chapter-184", "page_count": 0, "is_premium": true, "comments_enabled": false, "early_access_until": "2026-10-11T21:15:42.322478Z", "published_at": "2026-10-11T15:15:42.322478Z", "view_count": 0, "created_at": "0001-01-01T00:00:00Z"}, {"id": 261959, "series_id": 0, "number": 183, "slug": "chapter-183", "page_count": 0, "is_premium": false, "comments_enabled": false, "early_access_until": "2026-10-04T21:04:07.545367Z", "published_at": "2026-10-04T15:04:07.545367Z", "view_count": 0, "created_at": "0001-01-01T00:00:00Z"}, {"id": 261802, "series_id": 0, "number": 182, "slug": "chapter-182", "page_count": 0, "is_premium": false, "comments_enabled": false, "early_access_until": "2026-09-27T21:31:06.572927Z", "published_at": "2026-09-27T15:31:06.572927Z", "view_count": 0, "created_at": "0001-01-01T00:00:00Z"}]}, {"id": 2191, "slug": "echoes-of-the-reverse-planet", "title": "Echoes of the Reverse Planet", "alt_titles": ["\ucd08\uc778\uc758 \uac8c\uc784\ubc29\uc1a1", "Superhuman\u2019s Gaming Stream", "Superhuman Game Broadcast", "Superhuman Streamer (French)"], "description": "<p>After being transferred into the dimension of [Reverse Planet], the world's most popular online VR game, the ordinary college student Baek Woohyun returns.</p><p>It was the homecoming he had dreamed of\u2026 except the damn game is still running as if nothing ever happened, and the vengeful shades of comrades who died over there hound him day and night, urging him to take revenge.</p><p>Determined to uncover the connection between the game and the world he escaped from, Woohyun logs back into [Reverse Planet]. For better or for worse, he doesn't cross over again, but he does appear on a streamer's broadcast during a chance encounter\u2026 Then an anonymous watcher named \"Viewer 62\" sends him a message.</p><p>\"How does it feel to be back in reality?\"</p>", "cover": "https://cdn.asurascans.com/asura-images/covers/echoes-of-the-reverse-planet.682282.webp", "banner": "https://cdn.asurascans.com/asura-images/banners/echoes-of-the-reverse-planet.jpg", "status": "ongoing", "type": "manhwa", "author": "Haiendeu", "artist": "11D", "popularity_rank": 172, "bookmark_count": 16583, "rating": 9.075731497418245, "chapter_count": 52, "last_chapter_at": "2026-10-11T15:13:22.053257Z", "created_at": "0001-01-01T00:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-10-11T15:19:03.633085Z", "public_url": "/comics/echoes-of-the-reverse-planet-bd5bdaf8", "source_url": "/s/2191", "genres": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action", "slug": "action"}, {"id": 4, "name": "Adventure", "slug": "adventure"}, {"id": 16, "name": "Fantasy", "slug": "fantasy"}, {"id": 35, "name": "Mystery", "slug": "mystery"}, {"id": 48, "name": "Revenge", "slug": "revenge"}, {"id": 68, "name": "Tragedy", "slug": "tragedy"}], "latest_chapters": [{"id": 262153, "series_id": 0, "number": 50, "title": "Counterattack", "slug": "chapter-50", "page_count": 0, "is_premium": true, "comments_enabled": false, "early_access_until": "2026-10-11T21:13:22.053257Z", "published_at": "2026-10-11T15:13:22.053257Z", "view_count": 0, "created_at": "0001-01-01T00:00:00Z"}, {"id": 261904, "series_id": 0, "number": 49, "title": "Special Attention", "slug": "chapter-49", "page_count": 0, "is_premium": false, "comments_enabled": false, "early_access_until": "2026-10-01T19:49:55.156786Z", "published_at": "2026-10-01T13:49:57.303777Z", "view_count": 0, "created_at": "0001-01-01T00:00:00Z"}, {"id": 261718, "series_id": 0, "number": 48, "title": "Infiltration Operation", "slug": "chapter-48", "page_count": 0, "is_premium": false, "comments_enabled": false, "early_access_until": "2026-09-24T21:20:16.67807Z", "published_at": "2026-09-24T15:20:16.67807Z", "view_count": 0, "created_at": "0001-01-01T00:00:00Z"}]}, {"id": 2142, "slug": "a-dragonslayers-peerless-regression", "title": "A Dragonslayer's Peerless Regression", "alt_titles": ["\uc6a9\uc0b4\uc790\uc758 \ud074\ub798\uc2a4\uac00 \ub2e4\ub978 \ud68c\uadc0", "The Dragon Slayer's Regression on Another Level", "Dragonslayer's Class Regression", "\u7adc\u6bba\u8005\u306e\u300c\u683c\u300d\u306e\u9055\u3046\u56de\u5e30", "The Regressed Dragon Slayer's Absolute Path", "Peerless Regression of a Dragon Slayer", "Hoegwihan Deuraegon Seulleieoeui Jeoldaero", "L\u1ed1i \u0110i Tuy\u1ec7t \u0110\u1ed1i C\u1ee7a R\u1ed3ng H\u1ed3i Quy", "La R\u00e9gression In\u00e9gal\u00e9e du Tueur de Dragons", "Regresi\u00f3n Sin Igual del Asesino de Dragones", "A Regress\u00e3o Inigual\u00e1vel do Matador de Drag\u00f5es", "Regresi Tak Tertandingi Sang Pembunuh Naga", "Kan Yon Wela Rai Phai Khong Nak La Mangkon", "Die beispiellose Regression des Drachent\u00f6ters", "La regressione senza pari dell'ammazzadraghi", "Ejderha Avc\u0131s\u0131n\u0131n E\u015fsiz Regresyonu", "\ud68c\uadc0\ud55c \ub4dc\ub798\uace4 \uc2ac\ub808\uc774\uc5b4\uc758 \uc808\ub300\ub85c", "\u91cd\u751f\u9f99\u6740\u624b\u7684\u7edd\u8def", "\u041d\u0435\u0441\u0440\u0430\u0432\u043d\u0435\u043d\u043d\u0430\u044f \u0440\u0435\u0433\u0440\u0435\u0441\u0441\u0438\u044f \u0423\u0431\u0438\u0439\u0446\u044b \u0414\u0440\u0430\u043a\u043e\u043d\u043e\u0432", "\u0627\u0644\u062a\u0631\u0627\u062c\u0639 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0646\u0642\u0637\u0639 \u0627\u0644\u0646\u0638\u064a\u0631 \u0644\u0642\u0627\u062a\u0644 \u0627\u0644\u062a\u0646\u0627\u0646\u064a\u0646", "\u0e01\u0e32\u0e23\u0e22\u0e49\u0e2d\u0e19\u0e40\u0e27\u0e25\u0e32\u0e44\u0e23\u0e49\u0e1e\u0e48\u0e32\u0e22\u0e02\u0e2d\u0e07\u0e19\u0e31\u0e01\u0e25\u0e48\u0e32\u0e21\u0e31\u0e07\u0e01\u0e23"], "description": "<p>Zeke Draker, the first direct descendant of the Dragon Slayer family to fail awakening. Possessing the talent of a healer instead of a swordsman, he was cast out by his family. Struggling desperately to grow stronger, Zeke met a tragic end.</p><p>At the moment of his death, mysterious words appeared before his eyes:</p><p>[The soul of an Elder Dragon is engraved upon the will of the one who persists.]</p><p>[An irreversible, promised power is being activated.]</p><p>When he regained consciousness, he found himself back in the Dragon Slayer family that had abandoned him, 20 years in the past.</p><p>\"If I can become strong, I\u2019ll make use of anything and everything.\"</p><p>Armed with a newfound, immortal power, the legend of a Dragon Slayer in a class of his own begins.</p>", "cover": "https://cdn.asurascans.com/asura-images/covers/a-dragonslayers-peerless-regression.gif", "banner": "https://cdn.asurascans.com/asura-images/banners/a-dragonslayers-peerless-regression.jpg", "status": "ongoing", "type": "manhwa", "author": "Gon", "artist": "Exten Studio", "popularity_rank": 47, "bookmark_count": 66966, "rating": 9.044459190444591, "chapter_count": 106, "last_chapter_at": "2026-10-11T14:42:55.903851Z", "created_at": "0001-01-01T00:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-10-11T15:16:09.075669Z", "public_url": "/comics/a-dragonslayers-peerless-regression-bd5bdaf8", "source_url": "/s/2142", "genres": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action", "slug": "action"}, {"id": 4, "name": "Adventure", "slug": "adventure"}, {"id": 16, "name": "Fantasy", "slug": "fantasy"}, {"id": 43, "name": "Regression", "slug": "regression"}, {"id": 48, "name": "Revenge", "slug": "revenge"}], "latest_chapters": [{"id": 262152, "series_id": 0, "number": 106, "slug": "chapter-106", "page_count": 0, "is_premium": true, "comments_enabled": false, "early_access_until": "2026-10-11T20:42:55.903851Z", "published_at": "2026-10-11T14:42:55.903851Z", "view_count": 0, "created_at": "0001-01-01T00:00:00Z"}, {"id": 261957, "series_id": 0, "number": 105, "slug": "chapter-105", "page_count": 0, "is_premium": false, "comments_enabled": false, "early_access_until": "2026-10-04T20:29:12.420699Z", "published_at": "2026-10-04T14:29:12.420699Z", "view_count": 0, "created_at": "0001-01-01T00:00:00Z"}, {"id": 261809, "series_id": 0, "number": 104, "slug": "chapter-104", "page_count": 0, "is_premium": false, "comments_enabled": false, "early_access_until": "2026-09-28T01:08:23.735512Z", "published_at": "2026-09-27T19:08:23.735512Z", "view_count": 0, "created_at": "0001-01-01T00:00:00Z"}]}, {"id": 2179, "slug": "the-demonic-cult-instructor-returns", "title": "The Demonic Cult Instructor Returns", "alt_titles": ["Demon Instructor's Return", "\u9b54\u6559\u5b98\u6b78\u4f86", "Return of the Demonic Instructor", "Demon Instructor Returns", "\u5e30\u9084\u3057\u305f\u9b54\u6559\u5b98", "Ma Gi\u00e1o Quan H\u1ed3i Quy", "\uadc0\ud658\ub9c8\uad50\uad00"], "description": "The Central Plains fell to the invasion of the Demon Realm.</p><p>A martial artist, Sa Bigang, was ultimately dragged into that infernal world. After surviving the brink of death and enduring hell itself, he awakens ten years before the invasion ever began.</p><p>And now, Sa Bigang sets out to stop the Demon Realm\u2019s return.</p><p>To do that, he must restore order to the murim and build the ultimate force: the Undefeatable Corps.</p><p>As the man who will rewrite the past and safeguard the future...</p><p>This time, he will never lose.</p>", "cover": "https://cdn.asurascans.com/asura-images/covers/the-demonic-cult-instructor-returns.3bde6c.webp", "banner": "https://cdn.asurascans.com/asura-images/banners/the-demonic-cult-instru